OL,3,GNEWSAFifteen new members in Isle of Man
OL,4,Ageneral election
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer infrastructure minister Michelle
OL,7,FHaywood, former health and social care
OL,8,Fminister Lawrie Hooper, former
OL,9,Feducation, sport and culture minister
OL,10,FJulie Edge, and deputy speaker of the
OL,11,Fhouse Ann Corlett were also among the
OL,12,Fseven outgoing MHks that were not
OL,13,Fre-elected.
OL,15,FIn the western constituency of Glenfaba
OL,16,Fand Peel, Daniel Davison said it was
OL,17,F"surreal" to be the youngest ever MHK
OL,18,Fto be elected in Manx politics at the
OL,19,Fage of 18.
